Third-party components
----------------------

**Runtime dependencies of this work: none.**
The Go module has no third-party imports (`go.sum` does not exist).

**git** — this program invokes the `git` binary as a *separate process*
(`os/exec`), it does not link or embed any Git code. Git is GPL-2.0; running a
GPL program as a subprocess does not make this work a derivative of it. Git is
not distributed with this work.

**Beer CSS** (MIT) and the web fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1) are currently
loaded from a CDN at runtime, so they are not part of this distribution.
Before any release that vendors them into `web/`, their license texts must be
carried along — see docs/DESIGN.md §8.8.
